{"id":"forecast-17","section":4,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-17/audio-4.m4a","model":"small","duration":992.61,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":5.3,"text":"Part 4. You will hear a lecture about a special type of sneezing.","words":[["Part",0.0,0.42],["4.",0.42,0.84],["You",1.56,1.98],["will",1.98,2.14],["hear",2.14,2.36],["a",2.36,2.62],["lecture",2.62,2.94],["about",2.94,3.36],["a",3.36,3.56],["special",3.56,3.88],["type",3.88,4.38],["of",4.38,4.56],["sneezing.",4.56,5.3]]},{"start":6.08,"end":65.96,"text":"First, you have some time to look at questions 31 to 40. Now listen carefully and answer questions 31 to 40.","words":[["First,",6.08,6.84],["you",7.3,7.46],["have",7.46,7.62],["some",7.62,7.82],["time",7.82,8.14],["to",8.14,8.34],["look",8.34,8.54],["at",8.54,8.76],["questions",8.76,9.08],["31",9.08,10.08],["to",10.08,10.44],["40.",10.44,10.9],["Now",61.42,61.78],["listen",61.78,62.08],["carefully",62.08,62.58],["and",62.58,63.18],["answer",63.18,63.64],["questions",63.64,64.08],["31",64.08,65.12],["to",65.12,65.56],["40.",65.56,65.96]]},{"start":69.28,"end":76.9,"text":"Welcome to this lecture in the Health Sciences intended to inspire you and get you thinking about your research project.","words":[["Welcome",69.28,69.88],["to",69.88,70.18],["this",70.18,70.38],["lecture",70.38,70.84],["in",70.84,71.16],["the",71.16,71.3],["Health",71.3,71.54],["Sciences",71.54,72.08],["intended",72.08,72.66],["to",72.66,73.1],["inspire",73.1,73.66],["you",73.66,74.08],["and",74.08,74.62],["get",74.62,74.76],["you",74.76,74.94],["thinking",74.94,75.26],["about",75.26,75.66],["your",75.66,75.92],["research",75.92,76.34],["project.",76.34,76.9]]},{"start":76.9,"end":84.34,"text":"Today, I want to show you how even ordinary human behavior like sneezing, which normally","words":[["Today,",76.9,78.18],["I",78.58,78.86],["want",78.86,79.02],["to",79.02,79.22],["show",79.22,79.48],["you",79.48,79.7],["how",79.7,79.98],["even",79.98,80.4],["ordinary",80.4,81.14],["human",81.14,81.58],["behavior",81.58,82.16],["like",82.16,82.66],["sneezing,",82.66,83.38],["which",83.7,83.96],["normally",83.96,84.34]]},{"start":84.34,"end":87.86,"text":"happens when you get a cold, may be worth studying.","words":[["happens",84.34,84.8],["when",84.8,85.1],["you",85.1,85.26],["get",85.26,85.44],["a",85.44,85.62],["cold,",85.62,85.98],["may",86.6,86.84],["be",86.84,86.98],["worth",86.98,87.3],["studying.",87.3,87.86]]},{"start":89.08,"end":94.92,"text":"Have you ever been walking outside when a bright shaft of sunlight hits you between the eyes?","words":[["Have",89.08,89.44],["you",89.44,89.6],["ever",89.6,89.86],["been",89.86,90.12],["walking",90.12,90.5],["outside",90.5,91.18],["when",91.18,91.54],["a",91.54,91.68],["bright",91.68,92.0],["shaft",92.0,92.38],["of",92.38,92.68],["sunlight",92.68,93.1],["hits",93.1,93.78],["you",93.78,94.04],["between",94.04,94.38],["the",94.38,94.64],["eyes?",94.64,94.92]]},{"start":95.78,"end":102.68,"text":"The reaction of some people is immediate, an unpleasant prickling in the nose, an increase","words":[["The",95.78,96.08],["reaction",96.08,96.46],["of",96.46,96.72],["some",96.72,96.96],["people",96.96,97.34],["is",97.34,97.76],["immediate,",97.76,98.26],["an",99.06,99.42],["unpleasant",99.42,100.0],["prickling",100.0,100.78],["in",100.78,100.98],["the",100.98,101.1],["nose,",101.1,101.44],["an",102.08,102.28],["increase",102.28,102.68]]},{"start":102.68,"end":107.0,"text":"in their breathing rate and an uncontrollable watering of the eyes.","words":[["in",102.68,103.04],["their",103.04,103.2],["breathing",103.2,103.56],["rate",103.56,103.94],["and",103.94,104.54],["an",104.54,104.7],["uncontrollable",104.7,105.72],["watering",105.72,106.18],["of",106.18,106.54],["the",106.54,106.7],["eyes.",106.7,107.0]]},{"start":107.76,"end":112.18,"text":"Then, almost as quickly, they sneeze and gain relief.","words":[["Then,",107.76,108.28],["almost",108.62,109.04],["as",109.04,109.54],["quickly,",109.54,109.9],["they",110.5,110.62],["sneeze",110.62,110.92],["and",110.92,111.56],["gain",111.56,111.78],["relief.",111.78,112.18]]},{"start":113.02,"end":115.94,"text":"This may happen every time they go into the sun.","words":[["This",113.02,113.5],["may",113.5,113.68],["happen",113.68,114.1],["every",114.1,114.52],["time",114.52,114.88],["they",114.88,115.06],["go",115.06,115.26],["into",115.26,115.46],["the",115.46,115.66],["sun.",115.66,115.94]]},{"start":116.8,"end":120.4,"text":"This so-called photic or light sneeze is a reflex,","words":[["This",116.8,117.16],["so",117.16,117.38],["-called",117.38,117.66],["photic",117.66,118.28],["or",118.28,118.54],["light",118.54,118.9],["sneeze",118.9,119.28],["is",119.28,119.92],["a",119.92,120.06],["reflex,",120.06,120.4]]},{"start":120.84,"end":122.48,"text":"which means it can't be controlled.","words":[["which",120.84,121.12],["means",121.12,121.34],["it",121.34,121.54],["can't",121.54,121.88],["be",121.88,121.98],["controlled.",121.98,122.48]]},{"start":122.98,"end":124.26,"text":"And it's very common.","words":[["And",122.98,123.26],["it's",123.26,123.46],["very",123.46,123.76],["common.",123.76,124.26]]},{"start":124.78,"end":128.54,"text":"Anything between 1 in 10 and 1 in 3 people might be affected.","words":[["Anything",124.78,125.1],["between",125.1,125.54],["1",125.54,125.96],["in",125.96,126.08],["10",126.08,126.38],["and",126.38,126.72],["1",126.72,126.94],["in",126.94,127.1],["3",127.1,127.32],["people",127.32,127.7],["might",127.7,127.96],["be",127.96,128.14],["affected.",128.14,128.54]]},{"start":128.54,"end":135.84,"text":"In fact, a sneeze is triggered by an irritation of some sort in the linings of the nostrils.","words":[["In",128.54,129.8],["fact,",129.8,130.24],["a",130.76,130.9],["sneeze",130.9,131.16],["is",131.16,131.66],["triggered",131.66,132.08],["by",132.08,132.48],["an",132.48,132.66],["irritation",132.66,133.04],["of",133.04,133.58],["some",133.58,133.82],["sort",133.82,134.14],["in",134.14,134.38],["the",134.38,134.5],["linings",134.5,134.96],["of",134.96,135.12],["the",135.12,135.26],["nostrils.",135.26,135.84]]},{"start":136.78,"end":142.68,"text":"The result is a cascade of reactions beginning with the stimulation of the nerve endings","words":[["The",136.78,137.02],["result",137.02,137.38],["is",137.38,137.72],["a",137.72,137.86],["cascade",137.86,138.38],["of",138.38,138.86],["reactions",138.86,139.44],["beginning",139.44,140.3],["with",140.3,140.6],["the",140.6,140.78],["stimulation",140.78,141.32],["of",141.32,141.8],["the",141.8,141.94],["nerve",141.94,142.2],["endings",142.2,142.68]]},{"start":142.68,"end":150.76,"text":"all over the face and generating an explosive expulsion of air at up to 95 miles an hour,","words":[["all",142.68,143.24],["over",143.24,143.58],["the",143.58,143.76],["face",143.76,144.14],["and",144.14,144.9],["generating",144.9,145.46],["an",145.46,145.78],["explosive",145.78,146.56],["expulsion",146.56,147.5],["of",147.5,147.8],["air",147.8,148.18],["at",148.18,148.72],["up",148.72,148.9],["to",148.9,149.06],["95",149.06,149.68],["miles",149.68,150.12],["an",150.12,150.42],["hour,",150.42,150.76]]},{"start":150.98,"end":154.58,"text":"like an extremely localized personal hurricane.","words":[["like",150.98,151.48],["an",151.48,151.66],["extremely",151.66,152.42],["localized",152.42,153.26],["personal",153.26,153.94],["hurricane.",153.94,154.58]]},{"start":155.56,"end":161.5,"text":"The body's coordination of such reactions is complicated and belongs to the subconscious","words":[["The",155.56,156.26],["body's",156.26,156.74],["coordination",156.74,157.22],["of",157.22,157.76],["such",157.76,158.0],["reactions",158.0,158.54],["is",158.54,158.86],["complicated",158.86,159.46],["and",159.46,160.2],["belongs",160.2,160.54],["to",160.54,160.82],["the",160.82,160.98],["subconscious",160.98,161.5]]},{"start":161.5,"end":172.46,"text":"control hardware that regulates other things, for example tears in the eyes. People have","words":[["control",161.5,162.18],["hardware",162.18,162.78],["that",162.78,163.24],["regulates",163.24,163.8],["other",163.8,164.04],["things,",164.04,164.42],["for",164.96,165.08],["example",165.08,165.48],["tears",165.48,165.84],["in",165.84,166.1],["the",166.1,166.22],["eyes.",166.22,166.52],["People",171.96,172.28],["have",172.28,172.46]]},{"start":172.46,"end":177.82,"text":"been interested in the phenomenon of photic sneezing for thousands of years. The Greek","words":[["been",172.46,172.64],["interested",172.64,173.18],["in",173.18,173.48],["the",173.48,173.56],["phenomenon",173.56,174.04],["of",174.04,174.36],["photic",174.36,174.74],["sneezing",174.74,175.28],["for",175.28,175.46],["thousands",175.46,175.98],["of",175.98,176.24],["years.",176.24,176.54],["The",177.48,177.62],["Greek",177.62,177.82]]},{"start":177.82,"end":183.8,"text":"philosopher Aristotle asked, why does the sun prompt us to sneeze, whereas the heat","words":[["philosopher",177.82,178.3],["Aristotle",178.3,178.96],["asked,",178.96,179.76],["why",180.34,180.52],["does",180.52,180.78],["the",180.78,180.98],["sun",180.98,181.28],["prompt",181.28,181.8],["us",181.8,182.06],["to",182.06,182.22],["sneeze,",182.22,182.64],["whereas",183.1,183.38],["the",183.38,183.6],["heat",183.6,183.8]]},{"start":183.8,"end":190.9,"text":"of a fire does not. A partial answer came 2,000 years later, when the English philosopher","words":[["of",183.8,183.92],["a",183.92,184.04],["fire",184.04,184.38],["does",184.38,184.84],["not.",184.84,185.12],["A",186.2,186.4],["partial",186.4,186.78],["answer",186.78,187.3],["came",187.3,187.64],["2",187.64,188.02],[",000",188.02,188.4],["years",188.4,188.72],["later,",188.72,189.16],["when",189.66,189.84],["the",189.84,189.98],["English",189.98,190.24],["philosopher",190.24,190.9]]},{"start":190.9,"end":196.78,"text":"Francis Bacon showed that his photic sneeze had nothing to do with heat. If he closed","words":[["Francis",190.9,191.46],["Bacon",191.46,191.88],["showed",191.88,192.64],["that",192.64,192.84],["his",192.84,193.02],["photic",193.02,193.46],["sneeze",193.46,193.8],["had",193.8,194.18],["nothing",194.18,194.58],["to",194.58,194.8],["do",194.8,194.98],["with",194.98,195.2],["heat.",195.2,195.5],["If",196.14,196.28],["he",196.28,196.42],["closed",196.42,196.78]]},{"start":196.78,"end":201.5,"text":"his eyes when going into the sun, he didn't sneeze even though the heat was still there.","words":[["his",196.78,196.96],["eyes",196.96,197.24],["when",197.24,197.5],["going",197.5,197.74],["into",197.74,198.0],["the",198.0,198.16],["sun,",198.16,198.5],["he",198.96,199.08],["didn't",199.08,199.32],["sneeze",199.32,199.8],["even",199.8,200.22],["though",200.22,200.46],["the",200.46,200.58],["heat",200.58,200.82],["was",200.82,200.98],["still",200.98,201.22],["there.",201.22,201.5]]},{"start":202.36,"end":207.56,"text":"Henry Everett, a consultant psychiatrist at John Hopkins University Hospital in Baltimore,","words":[["Henry",202.36,202.9],["Everett,",202.9,203.38],["a",203.54,203.64],["consultant",203.64,204.08],["psychiatrist",204.08,204.74],["at",204.74,205.22],["John",205.22,205.42],["Hopkins",205.42,205.76],["University",205.76,206.14],["Hospital",206.14,206.96],["in",206.96,207.16],["Baltimore,",207.16,207.56]]},{"start":207.56,"end":211.4,"text":"more was the first to make a systematic attempt to understand the condition.","words":[["more",207.56,207.7],["was",207.7,208.14],["the",208.14,208.32],["first",208.32,208.54],["to",208.54,208.74],["make",208.74,208.92],["a",208.92,209.18],["systematic",209.18,209.52],["attempt",209.52,210.12],["to",210.12,210.36],["understand",210.36,210.76],["the",210.76,210.96],["condition.",210.96,211.4]]},{"start":211.84,"end":217.22,"text":"Noting in 1964 that 30% of the staff employed in the medical department","words":[["Noting",211.84,212.44],["in",212.44,212.68],["1964",212.68,213.46],["that",213.46,214.06],["30",214.06,214.46],["%",214.46,214.9],["of",214.9,215.12],["the",215.12,215.26],["staff",215.26,215.6],["employed",215.6,216.1],["in",216.1,216.3],["the",216.3,216.4],["medical",216.4,216.7],["department",216.7,217.22]]},{"start":217.22,"end":220.96,"text":"were photic sneezers, Everett did some further investigation.","words":[["were",217.22,217.5],["photic",217.5,217.84],["sneezers,",217.84,218.5],["Everett",219.04,219.4],["did",219.4,219.56],["some",219.56,219.78],["further",219.78,220.14],["investigation.",220.14,220.96]]},{"start":221.6,"end":226.02,"text":"He found that while 80% of sneezers reported other sneezes among their","words":[["He",221.6,221.9],["found",221.9,222.2],["that",222.2,222.34],["while",222.34,222.66],["80",222.66,223.12],["%",223.12,223.58],["of",223.58,223.76],["sneezers",223.76,224.22],["reported",224.22,224.7],["other",224.7,225.06],["sneezes",225.06,225.52],["among",225.52,225.76],["their",225.76,226.02]]},{"start":226.02,"end":229.54,"text":"relatives, only 20% of non-sneezers did.","words":[["relatives,",226.02,226.56],["only",227.16,227.48],["20",227.48,228.0],["%",228.0,228.36],["of",228.36,228.54],["non",228.54,228.76],["-sneezers",228.76,229.26],["did.",229.26,229.54]]},{"start":230.46,"end":234.12,"text":"Now there are factors that are certain indicators of a photic sneeze.","words":[["Now",230.46,230.74],["there",230.74,230.88],["are",230.88,231.08],["factors",231.08,231.58],["that",231.58,231.86],["are",231.86,231.98],["certain",231.98,232.32],["indicators",232.32,232.88],["of",232.88,233.28],["a",233.28,233.4],["photic",233.4,233.66],["sneeze.",233.66,234.12]]},{"start":234.12,"end":240.76,"text":"First of all, those with a condition almost always sneeze a set number of times on exposure to light.","words":[["First",234.12,234.84],["of",234.84,235.1],["all,",235.1,235.32],["those",235.68,235.92],["with",235.92,236.14],["a",236.14,236.24],["condition",236.24,236.76],["almost",236.76,237.28],["always",237.28,237.84],["sneeze",237.84,238.2],["a",238.2,238.52],["set",238.52,238.8],["number",238.8,239.08],["of",239.08,239.24],["times",239.24,239.6],["on",239.6,239.88],["exposure",239.88,240.26],["to",240.26,240.5],["light.",240.5,240.76]]},{"start":241.42,"end":248.98,"text":"In addition to this, the sneeze depends on a contrast invisible brightness, such as when the sun moves out from behind a cloud.","words":[["In",241.42,241.68],["addition",241.68,242.0],["to",242.0,242.22],["this,",242.22,242.48],["the",242.82,242.96],["sneeze",242.96,243.24],["depends",243.24,243.52],["on",243.52,243.9],["a",243.9,244.02],["contrast",244.02,244.48],["invisible",244.48,244.98],["brightness,",244.98,245.66],["such",246.3,246.66],["as",246.66,246.86],["when",246.86,247.04],["the",247.04,247.22],["sun",247.22,247.46],["moves",247.46,247.76],["out",247.76,248.0],["from",248.0,248.2],["behind",248.2,248.44],["a",248.44,248.62],["cloud.",248.62,248.98]]},{"start":249.94,"end":252.84,"text":"And the sneezing fit won't be repeated immediately.","words":[["And",249.94,250.22],["the",250.22,250.38],["sneezing",250.38,250.9],["fit",250.9,251.16],["won't",251.16,251.72],["be",251.72,251.86],["repeated",251.86,252.28],["immediately.",252.28,252.84]]},{"start":253.74,"end":256.46,"text":"The body needs time before it can be recharged.","words":[["The",253.74,253.9],["body",253.9,254.18],["needs",254.18,254.5],["time",254.5,254.92],["before",254.92,255.38],["it",255.38,255.58],["can",255.58,255.68],["be",255.68,255.84],["recharged.",255.84,256.46]]},{"start":256.88,"end":263.38,"text":"So if you go back into a darkened space and then immediately re-enter bright light, you will not sneeze again.","words":[["So",256.88,257.28],["if",257.28,257.46],["you",257.46,257.62],["go",257.62,257.74],["back",257.74,258.12],["into",258.12,258.4],["a",258.4,258.6],["darkened",258.6,258.98],["space",258.98,259.34],["and",259.34,259.82],["then",259.82,259.96],["immediately",259.96,260.56],["re",260.56,260.88],["-enter",260.88,261.12],["bright",261.12,261.44],["light,",261.44,261.78],["you",262.16,262.32],["will",262.32,262.44],["not",262.44,262.66],["sneeze",262.66,263.04],["again.",263.04,263.38]]},{"start":263.38,"end":268.47,"text":"Now on to possible applications of research in this area.","words":[["Now",263.38,264.14],["on",265.49,265.73],["to",265.73,265.85],["possible",265.85,266.29],["applications",266.29,267.01],["of",267.01,267.35],["research",267.35,267.73],["in",267.73,267.97],["this",267.97,268.13],["area.",268.13,268.47]]},{"start":269.25,"end":274.75,"text":"The photic sneeze had long been overlooked because its effects are generally less than serious,","words":[["The",269.25,269.41],["photic",269.41,269.81],["sneeze",269.81,270.05],["had",270.05,270.55],["long",270.55,270.81],["been",270.81,271.01],["overlooked",271.01,271.47],["because",271.47,272.19],["its",272.19,272.43],["effects",272.43,272.85],["are",272.85,273.23],["generally",273.23,273.67],["less",273.67,274.07],["than",274.07,274.27],["serious,",274.27,274.75]]},{"start":275.09,"end":279.09,"text":"although the government did once study it as a risk factor for pilots.","words":[["although",275.09,275.51],["the",275.51,275.71],["government",275.71,276.01],["did",276.01,276.39],["once",276.39,276.75],["study",276.75,277.17],["it",277.17,277.35],["as",277.35,277.55],["a",277.55,277.67],["risk",277.67,277.89],["factor",277.89,278.33],["for",278.33,278.63],["pilots.",278.63,279.09]]},{"start":279.85,"end":285.03,"text":"Yet work on such a simple disorder might lead to important discoveries on more acute conditions","words":[["Yet",279.85,280.43],["work",280.43,280.67],["on",280.67,280.91],["such",280.91,281.21],["a",281.21,281.39],["simple",281.39,281.67],["disorder",281.67,282.13],["might",282.13,282.37],["lead",282.37,282.63],["to",282.63,282.81],["important",282.81,283.21],["discoveries",283.21,283.75],["on",283.75,284.11],["more",284.11,284.33],["acute",284.33,284.69],["conditions",284.69,285.03]]},{"start":285.29,"end":291.01,"text":"such as migraine or epilepsy, which are also caused by cross-wires in the nervous system.","words":[["such",285.29,285.69],["as",285.69,285.85],["migraine",285.85,286.45],["or",286.45,286.73],["epilepsy,",286.73,287.31],["which",287.69,288.09],["are",288.09,288.21],["also",288.21,288.51],["caused",288.51,288.97],["by",288.97,289.17],["cross",289.17,289.45],["-wires",289.45,289.91],["in",289.91,290.13],["the",290.13,290.23],["nervous",290.23,290.47],["system.",290.47,291.01]]},{"start":291.01,"end":296.71,"text":"That is why I encourage you to select something similar for your first investigative medical","words":[["That",291.01,291.87],["is",291.87,292.01],["why",292.01,292.21],["I",292.21,292.49],["encourage",292.49,292.89],["you",292.89,293.13],["to",293.13,293.31],["select",293.31,293.65],["something",293.65,294.03],["similar",294.03,294.47],["for",294.47,294.93],["your",294.93,295.07],["first",295.07,295.33],["investigative",295.33,296.11],["medical",296.11,296.71]]},{"start":296.71,"end":300.65,"text":"project. It could be the beginning of something even more useful.","words":[["project.",296.71,297.39],["It",297.89,298.09],["could",298.09,298.21],["be",298.21,298.33],["the",298.33,298.47],["beginning",298.47,298.77],["of",298.77,299.09],["something",299.09,299.39],["even",299.39,299.79],["more",299.79,300.19],["useful.",300.19,300.65]]},{"start":302.09,"end":304.31,"text":"Now let's talk about the project timetable.","words":[["Now",302.09,302.41],["let's",302.41,302.69],["talk",302.69,302.87],["about",302.87,303.07],["the",303.07,303.21],["project",303.21,303.55],["timetable.",303.55,304.31]]},{"start":308.06,"end":314.7,"text":"That is the end of Part 4. You now have one minute to check your answers to Part 4.","words":[["That",308.06,308.38],["is",308.38,308.56],["the",308.56,308.74],["end",308.74,309.02],["of",309.02,309.2],["Part",309.2,309.44],["4.",309.44,309.84],["You",310.62,311.16],["now",311.16,311.42],["have",311.42,311.78],["one",311.78,312.08],["minute",312.08,312.44],["to",312.44,312.74],["check",312.74,313.02],["your",313.02,313.28],["answers",3